      {
        "key": "packaging_rules",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "The following provides the packaging rules for this qualification, followed by the list of relevant units of competency.",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "order": 1,
            "indent": null,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-1",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Total number of units = 13",
            "type": "bullet",
            "order": 2,
            "indent": 2,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-2",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": null
          },
          {
            "text": "4 core units plus",
            "type": "bullet",
            "order": 3,
            "indent": 1,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-3",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": null
          },
          {
            "text": "9 elective units, of which:",
            "type": "bullet",
            "order": 4,
            "indent": 1,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-4",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": null
          },
          {
            "text": "1 must be from Group A",
            "type": "bullet",
            "order": 5,
            "indent": 0,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-5",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": "packaging_rules-1"
          },
          {
            "text": "at least 6 must be from Group B",
            "type": "bullet",
            "order": 6,
            "indent": 0,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-6",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": "packaging_rules-1"
          },
          {
            "text": "no more than 2 may be from Group C",
            "type": "bullet",
            "order": 7,
            "indent": 0,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-7",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": "packaging_rules-1"
          },
          {
            "text": "no more than 2 may be from elsewhere in this or any other currently endorsed training package, or from an accredited course.",
            "type": "bullet",
            "order": 8,
            "indent": 0,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-8",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": "packaging_rules-1"
          },
          {
            "text": "Elective units must be relevant to the work environment and the qualification, maintain the overall integrity of the AQF alignment, not duplicate the outcome of another unit chosen for the qualification, and contribute to a valid industry-supported vocational outcome.",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "order": 9,
            "indent": null,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-9",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": null
          },
          {
            "text": "The elective bank contains both licensed and non-licensed units of competency relating to high risk work in the resources and infrastructure industry. To be appointed under any statutory requirements in related roles, units of competency should be selected to meet the state/territory licensing requirements.",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "order": 10,
            "indent": null,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-10",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": null
          },
          {
            "text": "There are prerequisites to imported units listed in this qualification. Where a unit is imported as an elective care must be taken to ensure that all prerequisites specified are complied with.",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "order": 11,
            "indent": null,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-11",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": null
          },
          {
            "text": "*Note the following prerequisite unit requirements.",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "order": 13,
            "indent": null,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-13",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": null
          }
        ],
